<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro guarantees a perfect green shot for a player with a 60 overall rating, both inside the paint and just outside it.

It is recommended to use the mouse on the button, like all other macros for shooting, but if this does not suit you or you do not have a mouse with side buttons, use anything.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 4 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 444 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyUp 4 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>